# Anchor OS commit message template
# Format: type(scope): TICKET-ID short description
#
# Examples:
#   feat(finance): FEAT-042 add recurring transaction auto-detection
#   fix(auth): BUG-117 resolve passkey assertion timeout on iOS
#   refactor(fabric): ARCH-001 split BehavioralEngine under 200 lines
#   chore(deps): bump firebase to 12.11.0
#
# Types: feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert deploy
# Ticket IDs: BUG-XXX FEAT-XXX ARCH-XXX AUTH-XXX ENG-XXX SEC-XXX GAP-XXX
#   (chore/style/docs commits may omit ticket ID)
#
